  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nGoogle Chrome has recently disabled triggering JavaScript using Apple Events on macOS by default - which was a very good idea. As a user I expected this to protect me from attacks based on malicious apps that send Apple Events. However it turns out that it is pretty easy"
